1
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:09,810
We came to Costco to get Kimchi.

2
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:16,130
Kelly. Yeah.

3
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:19,440
So a stranger asked me what Kimchi is.

4
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:21,130
Yeah.

5
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:25,060
Does it happen to you often in Costco too?

6
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:26,100
Maybe not ask.

7
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,060
I mean, I've had a few people ask what it is,

8
