50
00:03:43,650 --> 00:03:48,740
So everything else just didn't taste the same

51
00:03:48,740 --> 00:03:53,570
because that to me was what kimchi jjigae tasted like.

52
00:03:54,860 --> 00:04:00,500
But I don't even know, technically, was it really that good of one? I mean, probably not.

53
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:03,150
It's probably not that healthy of a one,

54
00:04:03,150 --> 00:04:05,410
but like that just to me was,

55
00:04:05,410 --> 00:04:08,060
the flavor of it was delicious.

56
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:10,280
And that's what I always based it off of.

57
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:14,040
And unfortunately, like your mom started cooking kimchi jjigae,

58
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:19,810
to me, it was just a completely different taste to what I liked from that restaurant.

59
